      "id": 14664503,
      "title": "[nf] ipvs: skip IPv6 extension headers in TCP state lookup",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705125659.37744-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705125659.37744-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705125659.37744-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "937084cb6ec3bc26eba097950434d02199e2606c",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Yizhou Zhao",
      "date": "2026-07-05T12:56:57",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 IPVS（IP Virtual Server）在处理 IPv6 TCP 包时的一个安全漏洞。tcp_state_transition() 函数原本使用 sizeof(struct ipv6hdr) 作为 TCP 头偏移量，没有跳过 IPv6 扩展头，而 ip_vs_fill_iph_skb() 已经通过 ipv6_find_hdr() 正确处理了扩展头并找到真正的传输层头位置。这导致当 IPv6 TCP 包携带扩展头（如 8 字节目的选项头）时，状态机会从错误的偏移处读取数据，可能把 TCP 序列号误读为标志位，使未完成的 SYN 连接错误地从 NONE 进入 ESTABLISHED 状态，获得 15 分钟的超时而非更短的 SYN_RECV 超时，造成远程拒绝服务。补丁改用 ip_vs_fill_iph_skb() 来获取正确的传输头偏移，与 tcp_conn_schedule() 和 TCP NAT 处理逻辑保持一致。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14664500,
      "title": "[net-next,v4,3/3] selftest: Add tests for useful handling of LSM denials on SCM_RIGHTS",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705123826.3818443-4-jkoolstra@xs4all.nl",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705123826.3818443-4-jkoolstra@xs4all.nl/",
