      "hash": "5f31882cbfe095b410bf0bad2940390b984faeb5",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Jori Koolstra",
      "date": "2026-07-05T12:38:26",
      "summary": "本补丁为 Linux 内核网络子系统添加了 af_unix 的 SCM_RIGHTS 套接字选项测试。具体通过 BPF 程序挂载到 security_file_receive() 钩子，模拟 LSM 拒绝行为，测试新增的 SO_RIGHTS_NOTRUNC 套接字选项在文件描述符传递被 LSM 拦截时的行为。BPF 程序与用户态共享一个 hashmap，用于指定接收端 tgid 下需要阻断的 inode 编号。该测试验证了当 LSM 拒绝部分 fd 传递时，套接字层能否正确处理而非直接截断丢弃。属于 net-next 中针对 Unix 域套接字与安全模块交互场景的回归测试。",
      "tags": [
        "Socket",
        "eBPF",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14664491,
      "title": "[nf] ipvs: skip IPv6 extension headers in SCTP state lookup",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705123040.35755-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705123040.35755-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705123040.35755-1-zhaoyz24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "edab0a86f6bbf60f89e44f71555914d804d44f3a",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Yizhou Zhao",
      "date": "2026-07-05T12:30:38",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 IPVS（IP Virtual Server）在处理 IPv6 SCTP 数据包时的一个偏移量计算错误。原代码在 set_sctp_state() 中通过 sizeof(struct ipv6hdr) 静态计算 SCTP chunk header 偏移，但未考虑 IPv6 扩展头（如 8 字节目的选项头）的存在。改用 ip_vs_fill_iph_skb() 函数来获取真实传输层偏移（iph.len），该函数内部通过 ipv6_find_hdr() 已正确跳过所有扩展头。这使得 SCTP 状态机能正确识别 INIT 等 chunk 类型，避免因错误读取验证标签首字节作为 chunk type 而错误地将连接从 NONE 状态置为 ESTABLISHED，导致超时不当及 active/inactive 计数器异常。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "包处理",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14664489,
      "title": "[net] tipc: fix NULL deref in tipc_named_node_up() on empty publication list",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705115958.1066751-1-bestswngs@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705115958.1066751-1-bestswngs@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705115958.1066751-1-bestswngs@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "6427eeba44fabe8822103d81f19b5a153fe4c6f3",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Weiming Shi",
      "date": "2026-07-05T11:59:58",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 TIPC 协议在空发布列表场景下的 NULL 指针解引用崩溃问题。在 named_distribute() 中，当传入的发布列表 @pls 为空时，skb_peek_tail() 返回 NULL，后续 buf_msg(NULL) 写入触发空指针解引用。问题出现在使用节点 ID 配置时，链路先于 TIPC_NODE_STATE 名称发布建立，触发 tipc_named_node_up() 在空 cluster_scope 上调用 named_distribute()。补丁在 named_distribute() 末尾增加空 skb 检查并提前返回，在 tipc_named_node_up() 中增加队列空检查以避免向 tipc_node_xmit() 传递空链表。该崩溃可由非特权用户在 user+net 命名空间触发，因此具有安全意义。",
      "tags": [
        "TCP/IP",
        "包处理",
        "驱动"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14664402,
      "title": "net: usb: sr9700: validate receive packet extent",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705083724.24494-1-pengpeng@iscas.ac.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705083724.24494-1-pengpeng@iscas.ac.cn/",
