      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pengpeng Hou",
      "date": "2026-07-05T08:37:24",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 sr9700 USB 网卡驱动中 rx_fixup 函数的接收包长度校验 bug。原代码将 len 与 skb->len 比较，但实际拷贝时源指针已经偏移了 SR_RX_OVERHEAD 字节，因此正确的边界应该是 skb->len - SR_RX_OVERHEAD。若不修正，可能导致越界读取，引发内核信息泄漏或崩溃。修改后将校验改为 len > skb->len - SR_RX_OVERHEAD，杜绝越界拷贝。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
    {
      "id": 14664401,
      "title": "net: usb: cx82310_eth: bound partial receive continuation",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705083609.23977-1-pengpeng@iscas.ac.cn",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705083609.23977-1-pengpeng@iscas.ac.cn/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705083609.23977-1-pengpeng@iscas.ac.cn/mbox/",
      "hash": "f665efe5f5214a88ca0b3342ad6fcae559e1f0a7",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Pengpeng Hou",
      "date": "2026-07-05T08:36:09",
      "summary": "该补丁修复了 USB 以太网驱动 cx82310_eth 中跨 URB 包重组的边界检查缺陷。原代码在 cx82310_rx_fixup() 中处理上一个 URB 未完成包时，未先验证当前 skb 是否包含足够的续传字节就直接 memcpy 和 skb_pull，可能导致越界读取。补丁增加了 fail-closed 的长度检查：若当前 skb 长度小于所需续传长度（按偶数字节对齐后），则丢弃该未完成包状态并返回，避免将后续 URB 的数据误当作陈旧的续传字节消费，保持跨 URB 包重组模型的正确性与安全性。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14664192,
      "title": "octeon_ep_vf: Fix RX page leak on napi_build_skb() failure",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260705031620.274396-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705031620.274396-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260705031620.274396-1-lgs201920130244@gmail.com/mbox/",
      "hash": "f77f1532602a4a0214ce2e7cce67cae4b51aa6e1",
      "commitRef": null,
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "new",
      "submitter": "Guangshuo Li",
      "date": "2026-07-05T03:16:20",
      "summary": "该补丁修复 Marvell Octeon EP VF 网络驱动中 RX 路径的页泄漏问题。函数 __octep_vf_oq_process_rx() 在调用 napi_build_skb() 之前已经清除了 buff_info->page，成功路径下页面会被 skb 消费，但若 napi_build_skb() 失败，页面既未被 skb 消耗，也未被释放，导致泄漏。多分片场景下，后续分片页面同样会被解映射并从环形槽位清除却没有 put_page()。补丁在三个失败分支（head page 单分片、多分片 head、多分片 fragment）处补充 put_page() 调用，确保所有页都被正确归还。属于驱动层内存泄漏修复，影响长时间运行的稳定性。",
      "tags": [
        "驱动",
        "包处理"
      ],
      "relevance": "high",
      "readingTime": 2
    },
