      "id": 14658973,
      "title": "[net-next,02/12] netfilter: x_tables: replace strlcat() with snprintf()",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260702105003.13550-3-fw@strlen.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260702105003.13550-3-fw@strlen.de/",
      "mbox": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260702105003.13550-3-fw@strlen.de/mbox/",
      "hash": "0d6a91a71641105007aa7b27c21264f31e850ae2",
      "commitRef": "9cc4d9720d70f391dca52a07e72652f1693a6239",
      "version": "",
      "prefixes": [],
      "isRfc": false,
      "isSeries": false,
      "state": "accepted",
      "submitter": "Florian Westphal",
      "date": "2026-07-02T10:49:53",
      "summary": "该补丁属于 Linux 内核 Netfilter 子系统的代码清理工作。针对 net/netfilter/x_tables.c 中的 xt_proto_init() 和 xt_proto_fini() 函数，将已被废弃的 strlcat() API 调用替换为 snprintf()。具体做法是将原先的 strscpy()+strlcat() 两步拼接改为单次 snprintf() 调用，通过将 FORMAT_TABLES/FORMAT_MATCHES/FORMAT_TARGETS 宏改为包含 %s 格式的模板（如 \"%s_tables_names\"），一次性完成 \"<前缀><后缀>\" 的 /proc 文件名构建。该改动本身不涉及功能性变化，主要目的是配合 KSPP 项目移除废弃的 strlcat() 接口，使代码更简洁，同时仍保留缓冲区溢出防护。",
      "tags": [
        "Netfilter",
        "Linux内核网络"
      ],
      "relevance": "medium",
      "readingTime": 3
    },
    {
      "id": 14658972,
      "title": "[net-next,01/12] netfilter: nfnetlink_hook: Dump nat type chains",
      "url": "https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260702105003.13550-2-fw@strlen.de",
      "patchworkUrl": "https://patchwork.kernel.org/project/netdevbpf/patch/20260702105003.13550-2-fw@strlen.de/",
